  "releaseNotes": "v1.10.15: Added SessionResumed event to GatewayClient, DiscordEvents, and Shard infrastructure. Fires when the gateway successfully resumes an existing session after a disconnect (t=\"RESUMED\"), distinct from Connected which only fires on initial/new READY. Shard _status now correctly returns to Connected on resume instead of staying Reconnected forever. WireShardEvents accepts onSessionResumed parameter.",
